yle or lighting need<br data-end=\"1187\" data-start=\"1184\">⭐ <strong data-end=\"1210\" data-start=\"1189\">Energy Efficiency</strong> &ndash; Featuring LED and smart lighting options<br data-end=\"1256\" data-start=\"1253\">⭐ <strong data-end=\"1275\" data-start=\"1258\">Fast Shipping</strong> &ndash; In-stock products are quickly delivered<br data-end=\"1320\" data-start=\"1317\">⭐ <strong data-end=\"1343\" data-start=\"1322\">Reliable Warranty</strong> &ndash; We stand by our products with full guarantees</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1661\" data-start=\"1454\"></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"2087\" data-start=\"1696\">&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"2087\" data-start=\"1696\">✅&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1743\" data-start=\"1698\">Collaboration with Influencers &amp; Bloggers</strong> &ndash; We actively partner with content creators who promote high-quality lighting solutions.<br data-end=\"1835\" data-start=\"1832\">✅ <strong data-end=\"1858\" data-start=\"1837\">Marketing Support</strong> &ndash; Our top affiliates receive exclusive promotional materials, including banners, images, and pre-written content.<br data-end=\"1975\" data-start=\"1972\">✅ <strong data-end=\"2000\" data-start=\"1977\">Exclusive Discounts</strong> &ndash; Affiliates can offer unique coupon codes and special promotions to their audience.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1661\" data-start=\"1454\"></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1661\" data-start=\"1454\">&bull; Payment terms:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1661\" data-start=\"1454\">🔹&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1477\" data-start=\"1457\">Commission Rate:</strong> Competitive commission on every successful sale<br data-end=\"1528\" data-start=\"1525\">🔹 <strong data-end=\"1542\" data-start=\"1531\">Payout:</strong> Monthly or performance-based payments<br data-end=\"1583\" data-start=\"1580\">🔹 <strong data-end=\"1606\" data-start=\"1586\">Tracking Period:</strong> Cookies valid for 30-60 days to maximize conversions</p>",
